<p style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8b87c0;">Security notice</p>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#1a1833; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.2;">Password updated</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a4869;">
  Hey <strong style="color:#1a1833; font-weight:600;"><%= @resource.email %></strong> — your Octacle password was successfully changed.
</p>

<hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #eeecf8; margin:24px 0;" />

<div style="background:#f6f5ff; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#6b68a0; line-height:1.5; border-left:3px solid #8b87c0;">
